  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25598390",
      "title": "Adding a \"User\" Component",
      "sourceHash": "77d8c8237d5c727eca9e0430ca4739f77ebb5bd2d9ca279cb3c82faf76b30fdc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "Attached you'll find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 4.88,
          "en": "a simple starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.88,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "basically a pretty empty React application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "with an empty app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.23,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "And once you've downloaded and extracted the attached file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 17.87,
          "en": "you just need to run npm-install to install all dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.87,
          "end": 20.08,
          "en": "like the React library and thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.08,
          "end": 21.59,
          "en": "once you ran npm-install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.59,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "which I already did here you run npm start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 26.15,
          "en": "to start this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.15,
          "end": 28.39,
          "en": "and you'll be greeted by such an empty screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.39,
          "end": 31.28,
          "en": "because currently there is nothing inside of AppJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.28,
          "end": 33.583,
          "en": "nothing inside of our app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.55,
          "end": 38.04,
          "en": "Now in the application, which you saw in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.04,
          "end": 40.55,
          "en": "I wanna have a couple of different areas,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.55,
          "end": 42.84,
          "en": "a couple of different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 46.27,
          "en": "We had that component where we could enter our name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.27,
          "end": 47.5,
          "en": "and our age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.5,
          "end": 49.76,
          "en": "We had that error modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.76,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "that error overlay component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 55.1,
          "en": "We had a button to submit this and to confirm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.1,
          "end": 58.36,
          "en": "that we saw the error in that error modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.36,
          "end": 62.1,
          "en": "and we, of course. also had that list of users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 65.36,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll start by roughly planning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.36,
          "end": 67.75,
          "en": "out the components we'll have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.75,
          "end": 70.24,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a new components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.24,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "in which I wanna store those components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 76.6,
          "en": "And I'll add a UI folder for general UI components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.6,
          "end": 78.2,
          "en": "which will have like the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.16,
          "end": 80.63,
          "en": "And in components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.63,
          "end": 82.41,
          "en": "I'll also add a second folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.41,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "and that will be my users folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 86.703,
          "en": "for all the user related components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.71000000000001,
          "end": 90.65,
          "en": "And now in there we can start adding component files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.65,
          "end": 92.4,
          "en": "and I'll start with that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.4,
          "end": 94.97999999999999,
          "en": "that allows us to add a new user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.97999999999999,
          "end": 96.78,
          "en": "Hence here in the user's folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.78,
          "end": 99.67,
          "en": "I'll add a new AddUser.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.67,
          "end": 103.263,
          "en": "which should hold the logic for us to add a new user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 106.4,
          "en": "Now in there I wanna have a React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.4,
          "end": 108.2,
          "en": "So, of course, we have to import React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108.2,
          "end": 109.49000000000001,
          "en": "from React as you learnt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.49000000000001,
          "end": 111.923,
          "en": "because we're going to use some JSX code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 112.96000000000001,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "I'll then add my AddUser component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "using this function syntax which we can use in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 123.44,
          "en": "an arrow function stored in a constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.44,
          "end": 125.35,
          "en": "Of course, as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.35,
          "end": 128.36,
          "en": "you can also add a function like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.36,
          "end": 129.61,
          "en": "nothing wrong with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129.61,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "but I'll go for this approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "and I'll export this as my default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 137.36,
          "en": "so that we can import that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.36,
          "end": 140.493,
          "en": "that function into another file and use it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.26,
          "end": 144.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, instead of AddUser in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.92000000000002,
          "end": 147.59,
          "en": "we wanna render something on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.59,
          "end": 151.05,
          "en": "which allows the user to enter a name and an age",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.05,
          "end": 153.223,
          "en": "and have a button to confirm all of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 154.21,
          "end": 158.64,
          "en": "Therefore, in here, I will add a form let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 163.64,
          "en": "and inside of that form I wanna have a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.05,
          "end": 165.99,
          "en": "where I say username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.99,
          "end": 168.57999999999998,
          "en": "and of course that should all be returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.57999999999998,
          "end": 171.34,
          "en": "so let's wrap it into brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.34,
          "end": 173.72,
          "en": "and then put a return statement in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.72,
          "end": 175.61,
          "en": "So there, I wanna have a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.61,
          "end": 178.32,
          "en": "and I wanna have an input where the user then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.32,
          "end": 180.83,
          "en": "is actually to type that username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 180.83,
          "end": 183.59,
          "en": "And that input will be of type text because well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 183.59,
          "end": 185.143,
          "en": "expect some text there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.54,
          "end": 187.83,
          "en": "Now for accessibility,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 187.83,
          "end": 191.65,
          "en": "we can also add an ID here username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 191.65,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "And then on the label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 195.53,
          "en": "we would add the for attribute normally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 195.53,
          "end": 200.02,
          "en": "Now for just like class is not a name that is available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 200.02,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "in JSX because these would be reserved JavaScript names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.11,
          "end": 207.7,
          "en": "and therefore it's htmlFor actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.7,
          "end": 210.4,
          "en": "that's the prop name for assigning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.4,
          "end": 213.32,
          "en": "that for attribute to a label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 213.32,
          "end": 215.87,
          "en": "And with that we connect it to that input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 215.87,
          "end": 218.48,
          "en": "and that's important for screen readers and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.48,
          "end": 220.85,
          "en": "so that they understand which label belongs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.85,
          "end": 221.683,
          "en": "to which input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "So we got that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "Now, I also need another pair of label and input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 234.32999999999998,
          "en": "for the age in years let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.32999999999998,
          "end": 236.35,
          "en": "And here the type will be number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 236.35,
          "end": 239.21,
          "en": "because I expect to get a number here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 239.21,
          "end": 243.373,
          "en": "Something like 31, 18, 25, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 244.29,
          "end": 246.21,
          "en": "Now I'll name this age,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 246.21,
          "end": 247.61,
          "en": "I'll give it an ID of age and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 247.61,
          "end": 251.34,
          "en": "the htmlFor prop here also has a value of age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 251.34,
          "end": 253.46,
          "en": "And with that I got these two inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 253.46,
          "end": 256.99,
          "en": "Now, below those I want to have a button of type submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 257.96,
          "end": 260.44,
          "en": "which will basically submit that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 260.44,
          "end": 263.783,
          "en": "And here I have AddUser as my text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 264.84,
          "end": 267.24,
          "en": "So that's a straightforward form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 267.24,
          "end": 268.58,
          "en": "Now, on the form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.58,
          "end": 272.18,
          "en": "I'll add the onSubmit prop to specify a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 272.18,
          "end": 275.44,
          "en": "that should be executed when that form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 275.44,
          "end": 279.58,
          "en": "and therefore here I will actually add a new function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.58,
          "end": 282.253,
          "en": "inside of the AddUser component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 283.44,
          "end": 288.2,
          "en": "Let's say AddUserHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 288.2,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "Now here, I expect to get my event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 293.758,
          "en": "and I will call event.preventDefault",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 293.758,
          "end": 297.22,
          "en": "to prevent that default which for the submission event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 297.22,
          "end": 299.99,
          "en": "is that a request is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 299.99,
          "end": 303.17,
          "en": "I don't want that default hence I prevent it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 303.17,
          "end": 306.7,
          "en": "And now can connect on submit here to AddUserHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 306.7,
          "end": 310.573,
          "en": "by passing AddUserHandler like this to onSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 311.59,
          "end": 313.61,
          "en": "Important as I explained before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 313.61,
          "end": 315.58,
          "en": "don't add parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 315.58,
          "end": 318.53,
          "en": "This would immediately execute AddUserHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 318.53,
          "end": 320.27,
          "en": "when this line is parsed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 320.27,
          "end": 322.4,
          "en": "Instead, I just want to pass a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 322.4,
          "end": 325.67,
          "en": "to that function to the onSubmit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 325.67,
          "end": 327.96,
          "en": "so that the form component internally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 327.96,
          "end": 330.72,
          "en": "can use that function when it needs to use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 330.72,
          "end": 333.153,
          "en": "i.e when that form is getting submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 334.15999999999997,
          "end": 338.59000000000003,
          "en": "So with that we get this AddUserHandler here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 338.59000000000003,
          "end": 343.40999999999997,
          "en": "Now let's go over to AppJS and let's import it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 343.40999999999997,
          "end": 348.40999999999997,
          "en": "So I import AddUser from ./components/Users/AddUser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 352.4,
          "end": 357.24,
          "en": "And here in the div we can then add AddUser like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 357.24,
          "end": 360.093,
          "en": "That's how we can add this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 361.16,
          "end": 362.12,
          "en": "And if we now save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 362.12,
          "end": 365.41,
          "en": "and go back we should see this relatively ugly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 365.41,
          "end": 368.04,
          "en": "but working component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 368.04,
          "end": 371.35,
          "en": "I can click AddUser and the page is not reloading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 371.35,
          "end": 373.38,
          "en": "which proves that this forms submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 373.38,
          "end": 376.953,
          "en": "is effectively handled and the default is prevented.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 377.8,
          "end": 379.29,
          "en": "So that's the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 379.29,
          "end": 381.03,
          "en": "Now, some styling would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 381.03,
          "end": 384.51,
          "en": "because that doesn't really look the way I want it to look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 384.51,
          "end": 387.01,
          "en": "Now, I'll start an index CSS there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 387.01,
          "end": 388.67,
          "en": "You got some basic styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 388.67,
          "end": 390.92,
          "en": "I'll go to the HTML element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 390.92,
          "end": 395.92,
          "en": "and add a background styling of 1F, 1F, 1F like this",
